  "worked_solution": "We will use the following identity:\n\n$$\n\u2207\\cdot (f\\,F)=f\\,\u2207\\cdot F+F\\cdot \u2207f\n$$\n\nFirst, we compute $\u2207\\cdot F$ and $\u2207f.$ We get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\u2207f & =\u27e82xy,{x}^{2}\u27e9, \\\\ \u2207\\cdot F & =\\frac{\u2202}{\u2202x}(xy)+\\frac{\u2202}{\u2202y}(2y)=y+2.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\u2207\\cdot (f\\,F) & =f\\,\u2207\\cdot F+F\\cdot \u2207f \\\\  & ={x}^{2}y(y+2)+\u27e8xy,2y\u27e9\\cdot \u27e82xy,{x}^{2}\u27e9 \\\\  & ={x}^{2}{y}^{2}+2{x}^{2}y+2{x}^{2}{y}^{2}+2{x}^{2}y \\\\  & =3{x}^{2}{y}^{2}+4{x}^{2}y \\\\  & ={x}^{2}y(3y+4).\\end{aligned}\n$$",
